<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Haruka Niimura is suspicious after all, you say.<PG>
She killed herself at the end, but she was convinced all along that she herself was the culprit, and she was also involved, to no small degree, in the past incident.<PG>
If by some means―for example a split personality or hypnosis―actions she did not intend had been taking place.<PG>
When in doubt, do not punish. But, where there's smoke, there's fire, would you say?<PG>
The theory that Haruka Niimura is the culprit, I find it classic and interesting.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
